<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rdf:RDF xmlns:cc="http://creativecommons.org/ns#" xmlns:dct="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:adms="http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#" xmlns:foaf="http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/" xmlns:odrl="http://www.w3.org/ns/odrl/2/" xmlns:owl="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#" xmlns:dcat="http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#" xmlns:lcon="http://www.w3.org/ns/locn#" xmlns:sioc="http://rdfs.org/sioc/ns#" xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xmlns:prov="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#" xmlns:skos="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xmlns:schema="http://schema.org/" xmlns:v="http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#" xmlns:vann="http://purl.org/vocab/vann/" xmlns:voaf="http://purl.org/vocommons/voaf#" xmlns:wdrs="http://www.w3.org/2007/05/powder-s#" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#" xmlns:spdx="http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#" xmlns:time="http://www.w3.org/2006/time#" xmlns:dcatap="http://data.europa.eu/r5r/" xmlns:stat="http://data.europa.eu/s1n/statdcat-ap/" xmlns:qb="http://purl.org/linked-data/cube#" ><dcat:Dataset rdf:about="http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/web/products-datasets/-/tipspd40"><dct:issued rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2024-09-30</dct:issued><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Konsolidiert/Nichtkonsolidiert</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Consolidated/Non consolidated</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Consolidé/Non-consolidé</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Finanzielle Position</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Financial position</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Position financière</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Zeitliche Frequenz</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Time frequency</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Fréquence (relative au temps)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Geopolitische Meldeeinheit</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Geopolitical entity (reporting)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Entité géopolitique (déclarante)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Volkswirtschaftliche Gesamtrechnungen Indikator (ESVG 2010)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">National accounts indicator (ESA 2010)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Indicateur des comptes nationaux (SEC 2010)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Sektor</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Sector</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Secteur</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Maßeinheit</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Unit of measure</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Unité de mesure</dcat:keyword><dct:type><skos:Concept  rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/dataset-type/STATISTICAL"/></dct:type><dct:title xml:lang="en">Household including non-profit institutions serving households (NPISH) debt, consolidated</dct:title><dct:description xml:lang="en">&lt;p&gt;The households sector debt is the stock of liabilities held by the sectors Households and Non-Profit institutions serving households (S.14_S.15).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The instruments taken into account to compile the household sector debt are Debt securities (F.3) and Loans (F.4). Data are presented in consolidated terms (meaning transactions within the same sector are not taken into account) and are expressed in % of gross adjusted disposable income (AGDI, B7G).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Definitions regarding sectors and instruments are based on the ESA 2010.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The MIP auxiliary indicator is the stock of households sector debt in percentage of AGDI. The indicator is calculated as: [HHSDt/AGDIt]*100.&lt;/p&gt;</dct:description><dct:title xml:lang="fr">Dette consolidée des ménages incluant les institutions sans but lucratif au service des ménages (ISBLSM)</dct:title><dct:description xml:lang="fr">&lt;p&gt;La dette du secteur des ménages correspond au stock de passifs détenus par les secteurs des ménages et des organisations à but non lucratif servant les ménages (S.14_S.15).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Les instruments pris en compte pour établir la dette du secteur des ménages sont les titres de créance (F.3) et les prêts (F.4). Les données sont présentées en termes consolidés (ce qui signifie que les transactions au sein d’un même secteur ne sont pas prises en compte) et sont exprimées en % du revenu disponible ajusté brut (AGDI, B7G).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Les définitions des secteurs et des instruments sont basées sur le SEC 2010 (Système Européen des Comptes). L&apos;indicateur auxiliaire de la PDM représente le stock de la dette du secteur des ménages en pourcentage de l&apos;AGDI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;L&apos;indicateur est calculé comme suit : [HHSDt / AGDIt] * 100.&lt;/p&gt;</dct:description><dct:title xml:lang="de">Verbindlichkeiten privater Haushalte einschließlich privater Organisationen ohne Erwerbszweck (OOE), konsolidiert</dct:title><dct:description xml:lang="de">&lt;p&gt;Die Schulden des Sektors der Haushalte entsprechen dem Bestand an Verbindlichkeiten, die von den Sektoren der Haushalte und der Organisationen ohne Erwerbszweck, die Haushalte unterstützen (S.14_S.15) gehalten werden. Die Instrumente, die zur Berechnung der Schulden des Sektors der Haushalte berücksichtigt werden, sind Schuldverschreibungen (F.3) und Kredite (F.4). Die Daten werden in konsolidierter Form dargestellt (was bedeutet, dass Transaktionen innerhalb desselben Sektors nicht berücksichtigt werden) und sind als Prozentsatz des verfügbaren, bereinigten Bruttoeinkommens (AGDI, B7G) ausgedrückt.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Die Definitionen der Sektoren und Instrumente basieren auf dem ESVG 2010 (Europäisches System Volkswirtschaftlicher Gesamtrechnungen). Der auxiliary indicator des VMU stellt den Bestand der Schulden des Sektors der Haushalte in Prozent des AGDI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Der Indikator wird wie folgt berechnet: [HHSDt / AGDIt] * 100.&lt;/p&gt;</dct:description><dct:identifier>tipspd40</dct:identifier><foaf:page rdf:resource="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/page/tipspd40"/><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/EUR"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/BEL"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/BGR"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/CZE"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/DNK"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/DEU"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/EST"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/IRL"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/GRC"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/ESP"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/FRA"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/HRV"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/ITA"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/CYP"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/LVA"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/LTU"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/LUX"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/HUN"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/MLT"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/NLD"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/AUT"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/POL"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/PRT"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/ROU"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/SVN"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/SVK"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/FIN"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/SWE"/></dct:spatial><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/CO_NCO" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Konsolidiert/Nichtkonsolidiert</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Consolidated/Non consolidated</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Consolidé/Non-consolidé</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/FINPOS" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Finanzielle Position</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Financial position</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Position financière</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/FREQ" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Zeitliche Frequenz</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Time frequency</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Fréquence (relative au temps)</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/GEO" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Geopolitische Meldeeinheit</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Geopolitical entity (reporting)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entité géopolitique (déclarante)</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/NA_ITEM" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Volkswirtschaftliche Gesamtrechnungen Indikator (ESVG 2010)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">National accounts indicator (ESA 2010)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Indicateur des comptes nationaux (SEC 2010)</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/SECTOR" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Sektor</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Sector</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Secteur</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/UNIT" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Maßeinheit</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Unit of measure</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Unité de mesure</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:attribute> <qb:AttributeProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/OBS_FLAG" /> </stat:attribute><stat:attribute> <qb:AttributeProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/CONF_STATUS" /> </stat:attribute><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/UNIT?code=PC_GADI"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Prozentsatz verfügbares Einkommen, brutto</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Percentage of gross adjusted disposable income</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Pourcentage du revenu disponible brut ajusté</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:numSeries rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">29</stat:numSeries><dct:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2025-05-17</dct:modified><dct:accrualPeriodicity><dct:Frequency rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/ANNUAL"/></dct:accrualPeriodicity><dct:temporal><dct:PeriodOfTime rdf:about="http://purl.org/dc/terms/PeriodOfTime/3169a64b-f3b3-4920-b709-b32c20b97678"><dcat:startDate rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">1995-01-01</dcat:startDate><dcat:endDate rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2024-12-31</dcat:endDate></dct:PeriodOfTime></dct:temporal><dct:accessRights><dct:RightsStatement rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"/></dct:accessRights><dcat:landingPage><foaf:Document rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/page/tipspd40"><dct:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/documentation-type/WEBPAGE_RELATED"/><schema:url xml:lang="en">https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/page/tipspd40</schema:url><dct:title xml:lang="en">More information on Eurostat Website</dct:title><dct:title xml:lang="fr">Plus d&apos;information sur le